Subject: [PATCH] Scraping off switch: the walker reads spy.walk_queue while
 Tracks scrapes

SWEEPER_CONCURRENCY=0 stops the sweeper and keeps every other job running.
tracks-bridge (Raposa-Industries/adhunters) writes Tracks' scrapes into spy
and files each ad's click link in spy.walk_queue (042), which now feeds the
landing page walker. Unset, nothing changes.

