+
+## Scraping off: Tracks feeds spy
+
+Scraping moves to Tracks (Raposa-Industries/adhunters, `tracks/`). Its
+`tracks-bridge` writes every Tracks scrape into spy with this repo's own
+writer logic, so the web app and every job here keep working unchanged.
+Set `SWEEPER_CONCURRENCY=0` for the collector to stop scraping: the walker,
+Raposa, the read model, grouping and the classifier keep running, and the
+walker takes its links from `spy.walk_queue` (042), which the bridge fills.
+Without that setting nothing changes. The switch-over steps are in the
+adhunters repo, `platform/SWITCH-OVER.md`.
